<title>UK: N.Ireland Elec H1 pretax profits rise.</title>
<headline>N.Ireland Elec H1 pretax profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		28.7		   vs 24.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.5		    vs 5.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     52.0		   vs 47.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   236.2		  vs 212.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 46.5 and 56.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Northern Ireland Electricity Plc</p>
</text>
